{
  "id": "dot-product",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Nokta Çarpımı",
    "en": "A Dot Product"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`a.iter().zip(b.iter()).map(|(x, y)| x * y).sum()`",
      "en": "`a.iter().zip(b.iter()).map(|(x, y)| x * y).sum()`"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn dot(a: &[i32], b: &[i32]) -> i32 {\n    a.iter().zip(b.iter()).map(|(x, y)| x * y).sum()\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", dot(&[1, 2], &[3, 4]));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn dot(a: &[i32], b: &[i32]) -> i32 {\n    a.iter().zip(b.iter()).map(|(x, y)| x * y).sum()\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", dot(&[1, 2], &[3, 4]));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(dot(&[1, 2], &[3, 4]), 11);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "iki",
            "en": "two"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(dot(&[1, 2, 9], &[3]), 3);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "kısa",
            "en": "short"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(dot(&[], &[]), 0);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "boş",
            "en": "empty"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "\\bfor\\b",
      "show": "for"
    }
  ]
}
